          </paramlist><![CDATA[DISCLAIMER: 

This model is part of the work conducted as part of a master’s thesis. However, the model has been altered and is not the exact model used to generate the results presented in the thesis.

Some values and parameters have been modified, most notably the cable modeling. In this version, the cables are modeled as PI sections, whereas the thesis model used frequency-dependent cable models. These changes have been made for confidentiality reasons.]]></Sticky>
